{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2143600/extras/48dae482441d0f32a941ddc41335d555.avif?t=1758112245\" width=616 height=250 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2143600/extras/636a33c9badabb275135018e8fc921ff.webp?t=1758112245\" width=616 height=4 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Axom: Conquest</i> is a <strong>Base-building Roguelike</strong> set on the hostile world of <i>Axom</i>. <strong>Build Defences</strong>, <strong>construct resource structures</strong>, and <strong>defend your Nexus Drill</strong> against relentless swarms. <strong>Purchase upgrades</strong>, <strong>unlock capsules</strong>, and <strong>adapt strategies</strong> as evolving alien hordes and the planet itself fight back against every move you make.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2143600/extras/636a33c9badabb275135018e8fc921ff.webp?t=1758112245\" width=616 height=4 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2143600/extras/fbb6ea240b825b4b71afd0c6fe3f83b7.webp?t=1758112245\" width=616 height=58 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2143600/extras/b6ab7c281f6e0bc04a79a1b2944e17a2.poster.avif?t=1758112245\" width=616 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2143600/extras/b6ab7c281f6e0bc04a79a1b2944e17a2.webm?t=1758112245\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2143600/extras/b6ab7c281f6e0bc04a79a1b2944e17a2.mp4?t=1758112245\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Design sprawling fortresses</strong> to protect your Nexus Drill against endless swarms of <i>Centurax</i>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Expand your economy</strong> by claiming and defending resource nodes scattered across the battlefield.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2143600/extras/636a33c9badabb275135018e8fc921ff.webp?t=1758112245\" width=616 height=4 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2143600/extras/9c5cc79fad5a2b29ffbf831ea5ddf739.webp?t=1758112245\" width=616 height=58 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2143600/extras/9bd4e80483daec903fd4f989d63a19b4.poster.avif?t=1758112245\" width=616 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2143600/extras/9bd4e80483daec903fd4f989d63a19b4.webm?t=1758112245\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2143600/extras/9bd4e80483daec903fd4f989d63a19b4.mp4?t=1758112245\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survive Relentless Escalation</strong>\u00a0- Enemies grow stronger, stranger, and more determined with every wave.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wild Synergies</strong> \u2013 Experiment with hundreds of upgrades, from bouncy walls to nuclear payloads. Stack them, twist them, and unleash chaos.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Alien Infection</strong> \u2013 Balance offence and defence while holding back the planet itself, as spreading corruption consumes the land, destroys structures, and forces constant adaptation.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2143600/extras/636a33c9badabb275135018e8fc921ff.webp?t=1758112245\" width=616 height=4 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2143600/extras/b2210c46bfd3e11497ff3cbd7617235c.webp?t=1758112245\" width=616 height=58 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2143600/extras/4f5adaf76aa4c19875b5f10b66ccffa7.poster.avif?t=1758112245\" width=616 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2143600/extras/4f5adaf76aa4c19875b5f10b66ccffa7.webm?t=1758112245\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2143600/extras/4f5adaf76aa4c19875b5f10b66ccffa7.mp4?t=1758112245\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Every Run is Truly Unique</strong> \u2013 Interlocking systems, procedural maps, branching towers, upgrade chains, corrupted upgrades, and evolving enemy threats combine to make no two runs alike.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Infinite Procedurally Generated Battlefields </strong>- No two battlefields are ever the same. Conquer every inch of Axom's unique surface</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build Your Way</strong> \u2013 Pick a Nexus variant before each run, each with unique stats and abilities that steer your strategy to your perfect fit.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2143600/extras/636a33c9badabb275135018e8fc921ff.webp?t=1758112245\" width=616 height=4 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2143600/extras/dbea984f8b3fdb99bdb2f188708003c3.webp?t=1758112245\" width=616 height=58 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2143600/extras/350515184ec9208eaa62ea125d036b6c.poster.avif?t=1758112245\" width=616 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2143600/extras/350515184ec9208eaa62ea125d036b6c.webm?t=1758112245\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2143600/extras/350515184ec9208eaa62ea125d036b6c.mp4?t=1758112245\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Discover a vast array of towers, hazards, and structures</strong> \u2013 each offering new ways to defend and experiment.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Evolve your defences with  variants</strong> \u2013 alternate versions of structures that twist familiar designs into something new.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2143600/extras/636a33c9badabb275135018e8fc921ff.webp?t=1758112245\" width=616 height=4 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2143600/extras/677fee5e3151321411bab67e02cab598.webp?t=1758112245\" width=616 height=58 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2143600/extras/5c02180f5b9890c790d030dfe1077e67.poster.avif?t=1758112245\" width=616 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2143600/extras/5c02180f5b9890c790d030dfe1077e67.webm?t=1758112245\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2143600/extras/5c02180f5b9890c790d030dfe1077e67.mp4?t=1758112245\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bend the Rules of Tower Defence</strong> \u2013 Corrupted upgrades and chaotic capsules twist the game in strange ways, breaking conventions and reshaping your strategy every run.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2143600/extras/636a33c9badabb275135018e8fc921ff.webp?t=1758112245\" width=616 height=4 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2143600/extras/11a91167d3b58456a5d144f3f87e9f6b.webp?t=1758112245\" width=616 height=58 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meta Progression</strong> \u2013 Advance through a vast research tree packed with upgrades, tools, and new options, unlocking lasting advantages that evolve how every run plays out.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Streamlined Controls</strong> \u2013 Fully playable with just a mouse, with keyboard shortcuts available for speed.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2143600/extras/636a33c9badabb275135018e8fc921ff.webp?t=1758112245\" width=616 height=4 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2143600/extras/52686289e9c6696b3b15f75885214298.webp?t=1758112245\" width=616 height=58 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2143600/extras/9056536d8de828c795dfb63dd02b3d79.poster.avif?t=1758112245\" width=616 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2143600/extras/9056536d8de828c795dfb63dd02b3d79.webm?t=1758112245\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2143600/extras/9056536d8de828c795dfb63dd02b3d79.mp4?t=1758112245\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>In the far reaches of the galaxy lies Axom, a planet overflowing with resources and positioned as one of the most valuable strategic strongholds for both trade and military power. Whoever conquers Axom could command wealth, influence, and dominance across the stars.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Many have tried to seize this prize. All have met tragic ends.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>But you are different. With your Nexus Drill, you stake a claim and begin carving into the planet\u2019s bounty, fortifying your position against the relentless Centurax, an alien swarm that rises in endless waves to repel every invader.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>But as you try something stirs. For beneath the surface lies a deeper reason why Axom has never been conquered\u2026 and why so many before you have failed.</i></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2143600?t=1758112245","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2143600?t=1758112245","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2143600/b3b9c9c7579c8c96e0308edb1faebdfff1608706/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758112245","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2143600/b3b9c9c7579c8c96e0308edb1faebdfff1608706/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758112245","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3514710,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2143600/extras/48dae482441d0f32a941ddc41335d555.avif?t=1758112245\" width=616 height=250 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"